        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a living, digital gallery featuring the vibrant works of Riley Magras.</strong><br>Wander through a stylized, immersive space where paintings come to life around you. Discover hidden paintbrushes tucked throughout the exhibit, explore interactive visuals, and engage with art in a way that blurs the line between gallery and game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to appreciate the atmosphere or hunt for every secret, <i>The Gallery - A Riley Magras Exhibit </i>invites you to slow down, look closer, and experience creativity from a fresh perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876120/extras/ac446869d49dc5f19ae82b7345b82f9c.avif?t=1756522297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876120/extras_big/ac446869d49dc5f19ae82b7345b82f9c.avif?t=1756522297 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876120/extras/403c36df46dd447d112975ddc1086601.avif?t=1756522297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876120/extras_big/403c36df46dd447d112975ddc1086601.avif?t=1756522297 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876120/extras/9922e7767c114f34bd3e6c73bc7138a3.avif?t=1756522297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876120/extras_big/9922e7767c114f34bd3e6c73bc7138a3.avif?t=1756522297 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876120/extras/51e8e8d0ad2e